{
  "id": "belts___power_transmission_and_efficiency",
  "title": "Belts - Power Transmission and Efficiency",
  "description": "Calculate belts power transmission and efficiency",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Input Parameters",
        "Values"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "F2",
          "label": "Force F2 (Tight Side)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "N",
          "defaultValue": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "F1",
          "label": "Force F1 (Slack Side)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "N",
          "defaultValue": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "radius_a",
          "label": "Radius of Pulley (ra)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "omega_a",
          "label": "Angular Velocity (ωa)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "rad/s",
          "defaultValue": 0
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "torque",
          "label": "Torque (T)",
          "formula": "(inputs.F2 - inputs.F1) * inputs.radius_a",
          "unit": "Nm",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "power",
          "label": "Power Transmitted (P)",
          "formula": "(inputs.F2 - inputs.F1) * inputs.radius_a * inputs.omega_a",
          "unit": "W",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Formulas\n\n**Torque:**\n\nT = (F₂ - F₁) × rₐ\n\nwhere:\n- T = torque (Nm)\n- F = force (N)\n- r = radius of wheel or pulley\n\n**Power Transmitted:**\n\nP = T × ωₐ = (F₂ - F₁) × rₐ × ωₐ\n\nwhere:\n- P = power transmitted (watts)\n- ωₐ = angular velocity (rad/s)"
    }
  ]
}